TerraciniLoci -- package for computing Terracini loci
*****************************************************

Description
===========

This package implements the algorithms from Section 8 of the paper Geometry of
first nonempty Terracini loci (see https://doi.org/10.1142/S0219199725500531 )
by F. Galuppi, P. Santarsiero, D. Torrance, and E. Turatti.

The Terracini locus of projective variety $X$ is a subvariety of the symmetric
power $X^{(r)}$ containing the closure of all sets $\{p_1,\ldots,p_r\}$ of
smooth points in $X$ for which the space $\langle
T_{p_1}X,\ldots,T_{p_r}X\rangle$ has less than the expected dimension.

This package exports one method, *note terraciniLocus: terraciniLocus,, for
computing the ideals of these varieties.

